    <item>
      <title>英伟达、微软和 Arm 都在预告英伟达的新款 N1X 笔记本处理器 | PC 新世代</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2272020</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2272020</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 00:58:22 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;aside class=&quot;onebox allowlistedgeneric&quot; data-onebox-src=&quot;https://www.theverge.com/news/940275/nvidia-n1x-laptop-processor-arm-microsoft-teaser&quot;&gt;
  &lt;header class=&quot;source&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/2/3/023fcb16f7d2160baff751704370bb7f2ac18c82.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;5200FF&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot;&gt;

      &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theverge.com/news/940275/nvidia-n1x-laptop-processor-arm-microsoft-teaser&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot; title=&quot;11:03PM - 29 May 2026&quot;&gt;The Verge – 29 May 26&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;aspect-image&quot; style=&quot;--aspect-ratio:690/360;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/9/f/e9fae2cc44f8d5b365cc8f2b8ec14d1add594339_2_690x358.jpeg&quot; class=&quot;thumbnail&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;373329&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;358&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theverge.com/news/940275/nvidia-n1x-laptop-processor-arm-microsoft-teaser&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Nvidia, Microsoft, and Arm are all teasing Nvidia’s new N1X laptop processors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;All eyes area now on Nvidia’s keynote at Computex on Sunday night.&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;onebox-metadata&quot;&gt;
    
    
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div style=&quot;clear: both&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!quote]+&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nvidia 即将在本周末举行的 Computex 上发布自己的 Arm 驱动笔记本电脑芯片，这是世界上最不能公开的秘密，现在微软、Nvidia 和 Arm 都在公开预告这一消息。今天早些时候，X 上的 Windows 和 Nvidia GeForce 账户都发布了 &quot;PC 新时代 &quot;的帖子，现在 Arm 也跟进发布了相同的帖子。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这三篇帖子都有指向台北电脑展举办地点的坐标。Nvidia 将于北京时间周日晚 8 点/美国东部时间周日晚 11 点在台北举行 Computex 主题演讲，据传将发布新的 N1 和 N1x 笔记本电脑芯片。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.barrons.com/articles/nvidia-chips-microsoft-pcs-gtc-3b516c98&quot; class=&quot;onebox&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://www.barrons.com/articles/nvidia-chips-microsoft-pcs-gtc-3b516c98&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;5 个帖子 - 4 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2272020&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
